## ✅ Subtask 2.2 Completed

**Summary:** Successfully modified the `filteredItems` computation to include text search filtering.

### Changes Made:
- Modified `filteredItems` (lines 358-370) in `src/screens/LibraryScreen.tsx`
- Added case-insensitive search filtering using `debouncedSearchQuery`
- Filter logic now uses AND logic: items must match both type filter AND search query (if present)

### Implementation Details:
```javascript
const filteredItems = libraryItems.filter(item => {
  // Type filtering
  if (filter === 'movies' && item.type !== 'movie') return false;
  if (filter === 'series' && item.type !== 'series') return false;

  // Search query filtering (case-insensitive)
  if (debouncedSearchQuery) {
    const searchLower = debouncedSearchQuery.toLowerCase();
    if (!item.name.toLowerCase().includes(searchLower)) return false;
  }

  return true;
});
```

